<title>UK: ICCO seeks bids for 4,250 tonnes of cocoa.</title>
<headline>ICCO seeks bids for 4,250 tonnes of cocoa.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The International Cocoa Organization (ICCO) said it was seeking bids by 1140 GMT Tuesday to buy 4,250 tonnes of its buffer stock cocoa.</p>
<p>The buffer stock manager said in a statement the cocoa for sale related to the list published on August 19.</p>
<p>The statement said the ICCO would communicate with the successful bidders by 1300 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Jalil Hamid, London Newsroom 044 171 542 4985</p>
